---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="about">
	<div class="about-bg-particles">
		<div class="particle-about"></div>
		<div class="particle-about"></div>
		<div class="particle-about"></div>
		<div class="particle-about"></div>
		<div class="particle-about"></div>
		<div class="particle-about"></div>
	</div>
	
	<div class="container">
		<h2 class="about-title">Sobre Mí</h2>
		
		<div class="about-content">
			<div class="about-text">
				<div class="text-highlight">
					<p>Estudio Ingeniería en Sistemas de Información en la UTN y cuento con el título de Analista Desarrollador de Sistemas de Información. Trabajo con un enfoque metódico y aprendo rápidamente en nuevos entornos tecnológicos.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="text-highlight">
					<p>Me dedico a crear soluciones claras y bien estructuradas, priorizando la eficiencia, la calidad y la mantenibilidad. Cada proyecto lo abordo con criterio técnico y orientado al impacto real del producto.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="text-highlight">
					<p>Estoy comprometido con el aprendizaje continuo y la adopción de buenas prácticas para desarrollar proyectos sólidos y escalables.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="about-visual">
				<div class="tech-pattern">
					<div class="pattern-element core"></div>
					<div class="pattern-element orbit-1"></div>
					<div class="pattern-element orbit-2"></div>
					<div class="pattern-element orbit-3"></div>
					<div class="pattern-element satellite"></div>
					<div class="connection-lines">
						<svg class="connections" viewBox="0 0 300 300" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M150 80 L120 120 L180 120 Z" stroke="rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.3)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
							<path d="M150 220 L120 180 L180 180 Z" stroke="rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.3)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
							<path d="M80 150 L120 120 L120 180 Z" stroke="rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.3)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
							<path d="M220 150 L180 120 L180 180 Z" stroke="rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.3)" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	/* --- ESTILOS PRINCIPALES --- */
	.about {
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
		background-color: #072215; /* Fondo oscuro alternativo para separar secciones */
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
	}

	/* Patrón de fondo sutil SVG */
	.about::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><pattern id="leaves" width="30" height="30" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M15 8 Q20 3 25 8 Q20 13 15 8" fill="none" stroke="%2313A054" stroke-width="0.3" opacity="0.1"/><circle cx="15" cy="8" r="1" fill="%2313A054" opacity="0.15"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(%23leaves)"/></svg>');
		pointer-events: none;
		animation: patternFloat 25s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes patternFloat {
		0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg); }
		50% { transform: translate(-10px, -5px) rotate(1deg); }
	}

	/* --- PARTÍCULAS --- */
	.about-bg-particles {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.particle-about {
		position: absolute;
		width: 4px;
		height: 4px;
		background: #13A054;
		border-radius: 50%;
		opacity: 0.3;
		animation: particleDrift 12s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	.particle-about:nth-child(1) { top: 15%; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
	.particle-about:nth-child(2) { top: 25%; right: 20%; animation-delay: 3s; }
	.particle-about:nth-child(3) { bottom: 35%; left: 25%; animation-delay: 6s; }
	.particle-about:nth-child(4) { top: 70%; right: 15%; animation-delay: 9s; }
	.particle-about:nth-child(5) { bottom: 15%; right: 30%; animation-delay: 12s; }
	.particle-about:nth-child(6) { top: 45%; left: 70%; animation-delay: 15s; }

	@keyframes particleDrift {
		0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) translateX(0px) scale(1); opacity: 0.2; }
		50% { transform: translateY(-25px) translateX(20px) scale(1.3); opacity: 0.5; }
	}

	/* --- CONTENEDOR Y TÍTULO --- */
	.container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
	}

	.about h2 {
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
		color: #DAFFF0;
		font-weight: 800;
		position: relative;
		animation: titleSlideIn 1s ease-out;
	}

	.about-title::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		bottom: -14px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		width: 90px;
		height: 4px;
		background: #13A054;
		border-radius: 999px;
		animation: lineExpand 1s ease-out 0.5s both;
	}

	@keyframes titleSlideIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-30px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
	@keyframes lineExpand { from { width: 0; } to { width: 90px; } }

	/* --- LAYOUT A DOS COLUMNAS --- */
	.about-content {
		display: flex;
		gap: 4rem;
		align-items: center;
		animation: contentFadeIn 1s ease-out 0.3s both;
	}

	@keyframes contentFadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

	/* --- TEXTOS (TARJETAS GLASSMORPHISM) --- */
	.about-text {
		flex: 1.2;
	}

	.text-highlight {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding: 1.8rem;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		border-left: 4px solid #13A054;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(168, 231, 204, 0.05);
		border-right: 1px solid rgba(168, 231, 204, 0.05);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(168, 231, 204, 0.05);
		border-radius: 0 16px 16px 0;
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
		animation: highlightSlideIn 0.8s ease-out both;
	}

	.text-highlight:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
	.text-highlight:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.7s; }
	.text-highlight:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.9s; }

	.text-highlight:hover {
		transform: translateX(8px);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		border-color: rgba(168, 231, 204, 0.2);
		border-left-color: #13A054;
		box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
	}

	@keyframes highlightSlideIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-40px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); } }

	.about-text p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin: 0;
		color: #A9B8AF;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	/* --- GRÁFICO ANIMADO DERECHO --- */
	.about-visual {
		flex: 0.8;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		animation: visualSlideIn 1s ease-out 0.8s both;
	}

	@keyframes visualSlideIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(50px) scale(0.9); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0) scale(1); } }

	.tech-pattern {
		position: relative;
		width: 320px;
		height: 320px;
		animation: patternRotate 25s linear infinite;
	}

	@keyframes patternRotate { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

	.pattern-element {
		position: absolute;
		border-radius: 50%;
		transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.pattern-element:hover {
		transform: scale(1.15) !important;
		box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.6);
	}

	/* Núcleo Central */
	.pattern-element.core {
		width: 80px;
		height: 80px;
		background: #13A054;
		border: 2px solid #DAFFF0;
		top: 50%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.4);
		animation: corePulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes corePulse {
		0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.4); transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
		50% { box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.7); transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.05); }
	}

	/* Órbitas y Satélites */
	.pattern-element.orbit-1 {
		width: 50px;
		height: 50px;
		background: rgba(19, 160, 84, 0.2);
		border: 1px solid #13A054;
		backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
		top: 20%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		animation: orbit1 10s linear infinite;
	}

	@keyframes orbit1 {
		from { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(0deg) translateY(-120px) rotate(0deg); }
		to { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(360deg) translateY(-120px) rotate(-360deg); }
	}

	.pattern-element.orbit-2 {
		width: 40px;
		height: 40px;
		background: rgba(168, 231, 204, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 231, 204, 0.5);
		top: 50%;
		right: 15%;
		animation: orbit2 14s linear infinite reverse;
	}

	@keyframes orbit2 {
		from { transform: rotate(0deg) translateX(120px) rotate(0deg); }
		to { transform: rotate(360deg) translateX(120px) rotate(-360deg); }
	}

	.pattern-element.orbit-3 {
		width: 35px;
		height: 35px;
		background: rgba(218, 255, 240, 0.05);
		border: 1px solid rgba(218, 255, 240, 0.3);
		bottom: 20%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		animation: orbit3 12s linear infinite;
	}

	@keyframes orbit3 {
		from { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(0deg) translateY(120px) rotate(0deg); }
		to { transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(360deg) translateY(120px) rotate(-360deg); }
	}

	.pattern-element.satellite {
		width: 20px;
		height: 20px;
		background: #A8E7CC;
		border: 1px solid #DAFFF0;
		top: 10%;
		right: 20%;
		box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(168, 231, 204, 0.5);
		animation: satelliteMove 15s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes satelliteMove {
		0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) translateX(0px) scale(1); }
		25% { transform: translateY(-20px) translateX(30px) scale(1.1); }
		50% { transform: translateY(10px) translateX(60px) scale(0.9); }
		75% { transform: translateY(-10px) translateX(30px) scale(1.05); }
	}

	/* Líneas de conexión SVG */
	.connection-lines {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.connections path {
		stroke-dasharray: 6, 6;
		animation: dashFlow 4s linear infinite;
	}

	@keyframes dashFlow { to { stroke-dashoffset: -12; } }

	/* --- RESPONSIVE --- */
	@media (max-width: 992px) {
		.about-content { flex-direction: column; gap: 3.5rem; }
		.about-text { order: 2; }
		.about-visual { order: 1; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
		.about h2 { font-size: 2.4rem; }
		.about-title::after { width: 70px; }
		.text-highlight { padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
		.tech-pattern { width: 260px; height: 260px; }
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.about::before, .particle-about, .tech-pattern, .pattern-element.core, 
		.pattern-element.orbit-1, .pattern-element.orbit-2, .pattern-element.orbit-3, 
		.pattern-element.satellite, .connections path, .about h2, .about-title::after, 
		.about-content, .text-highlight, .about-visual {
			animation: none !important;
			transform: none !important;
			opacity: 1 !important;
		}
	}
</style>